;; AudioMixer_MixChunk(d0 = bytes, a0/a1 = voice 0/1 read pointers, a3/a5 = volume rows, a2 = destination) :
;; inner mixing loop called by the mixer VBL routine (L_01cca). Adds the two voices through the volume
;; table and writes each mixed byte pair 4 times (8 bytes per source byte) into the DMA ring buffer.
